\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Comparison of cloud classification methods. The left panel illustrates the new method, which preserves cloud homogeneity and provides a more realistic classification. The right panel shows the old method used in recent studies, where cloud classification is done by time.\relax }}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
